## Comprehensive Implementation Plan: City Life Story

### Architecture Overview

The game currently has 17 JS source files totaling approximately 7,000 lines across core/, data/, phase1/, phase2/, and ui/ directories. The build system (build.py) inlines everything into a single dist/index.html. The state management uses a centralized GameStateManager with proxy-based dirty tracking. All rendering is imperative DOM manipulation with no framework.

